WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.359
Read the stories about Mike and Jackie during gym class.

00:00:03.359 --> 00:00:05.560
The gym teacher is trying to help them do better,

00:00:05.560 --> 00:00:07.280
but uses some tough words.

00:00:07.280 --> 00:00:10.480
For Jackie, the words don't seem to bother her much.

00:00:10.480 --> 00:00:13.400
But for Mike, you can tell the words are bothering him.

00:00:13.400 --> 00:00:15.240
Why do you think Mike feels more hurt

00:00:15.240 --> 00:00:17.199
by Mr. Ramos' language?

00:00:17.199 --> 00:00:20.719
A, he's heard that he's lazy before from other teachers.

00:00:20.719 --> 00:00:24.640
B, he says in a more mean tone than when he says it's Jackie.

00:00:24.640 --> 00:00:27.519
C, coach Ramos does it in front of someone he likes,

00:00:27.519 --> 00:00:29.160
or D, all of the above.

